Items.Ember_Glut_Lance.name = Ember Lance
Items.Ember_Glut_Lance.description = MK2. Primary: 22 damage, 3.5-block reach. Hold secondary 0.7 s, then release: 18 fire damage and burning over 4.5 blocks; uses 2 fuel seconds. Carry MK1–Infinite fuel.
Items.Ember_Return_Chakram.name = Returning Chakram
Items.Ember_Return_Chakram.description = MK2. Throws a reusable ring up to 12 blocks. Returns automatically. 18 damage per target on each flight leg; one active ring per player. Cuts sword-breakable grass and plants in flight, with normal drops. Cannot hit through walls.
Items.Ember_Harpoon_Launcher.name = Harpoon Launcher
Items.Ember_Harpoon_Launcher.description = MK3. Uses one harpoon. 12 impact damage. Pulls small targets toward you; large targets are only slowed for 2 seconds. 2.2 s firing interval. F: select carried ammunition; stays selected until empty or changed.
Items.Ember_Ammo_Harpoon.name = Barbed Harpoon
Items.Ember_Ammo_Harpoon.description = Harpoon Launcher ammunition. One per shot.\nBatch: 24 per craft.\nStation: Ammunition Bench MK3 - Arrows & Harpoons
Items.Ember_Coil_Thrower.name = Coil Thrower
Items.Ember_Coil_Thrower.description = MK3. Uses one energy charge; eight shots per energy cell. Impact discharges electricity: 24 damage once to every visible target within 4 blocks, excluding the shooter. Effect ends within 0.6 s; 2.8 s cooldown. F: select carried ammunition; stays selected until empty or changed.
Items.Ember_Slag_Launcher.name = Slag Launcher
Items.Ember_Slag_Launcher.description = MK3. Direct hits deal 24 damage in a 1.8-block radius. Terrain hits split into eight arcing fragments, each dealing 14.4 damage (60%). Uses slag rounds; 1.6 s firing interval. Does not damage terrain. F: select carried ammunition; stays selected until empty or changed.
Items.Ember_Ammo_Slag.name = Slag Round
Items.Ember_Ammo_Slag.description = Ammunition for the Slag Launcher. Made from casting by-products.\nBatch: 12 per craft.\nStation: Ammunition Bench MK3 - Heavy Ammunition
Items.Ember_Slag.name = Casting Slag
Items.Ember_Slag.description = One slag is produced alongside each casting operation. Used to craft slag rounds. Keep both product slots available.
Items.Ember_Signal_Pistol.name = Pollen Signal Pistol
Items.Ember_Signal_Pistol.description = MK2. Fires a pollen flare in your aim direction. One large burst after 20 blocks; blocks and the upper world boundary end the flight early. Festival ammunition rises to 20-25 blocks above launch. A coloured firework falls slowly and fades over 45–50 s; its location appears on the map for everyone in this world for the same time. Primary: fire. Secondary: select a carried colour. Uses one flare; no damage. F: select carried ammunition; stays selected until empty or changed.
Items.Ember_Ammo_Signal_Copper.name = Amber Signal Flare
Items.Ember_Ammo_Signal_Copper.description = MK2. Amber signal; its colour comes from the pollen used in crafting. Four per recipe. Carry for the Signal Pistol; secondary selects the colour. Firework and shared map marker last up to 50 s.\nBatch: 12 per craft.\nStation: Ammunition Bench MK2 - Signals & Fireworks
