Items.Ember_Ammo_Signal_Festival.name = Festival Firework Round
Items.Ember_Ammo_Signal_Festival.description = MK2. Signal Pistol ammunition with a multicoloured trail. Bursts into five multicoloured balls with random sizes and delays. Each glows for 10 s, then fades over 5 s. Four rounds from three Spectral Bloom pollen, one copper plate and one pressed coal rod. Secondary selects this ammunition.\nBatch: 12 per craft.\nStation: Ammunition Bench MK2 - Signals & Fireworks
